          "message": "fix(auth): shut down the OAuth callback server gracefully (#130)\n\nWait for callback responses before closing connections to avoid\nintermittent browser EOF errors. Bound shutdown to one second\nand cover active responses, forced closure after cancellation,\nand the complete browser response.\n\nAssisted-by: pi:gpt-6.1-sol\nCo-authored-by: bircni <redacted@example.invalid>\nReviewed-on: https://gitea.com/gitea/cli/pulls/130\nReviewed-by: bircni <redacted@example.invalid>\nCo-authored-by: Matěj Cepl <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
